        "original_id": "2d081638-f340-5462-abe0-fddb3ffa965a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ricardo Delgado, Brad Bird, R.C. Welch, Q.L. Pearce, Bartt Warbuton, Dwight Been\n- Films: The Incredibles, Men in Black, Apollo 13\n- Books/Series: Scary Stories for Sleep-overs\n- Companies: Pixar Animation Studios, Walt Disney Pictures\n\nFacts:\n- Ricardo Delgado is a film and comic book artist.\n- Ricardo Delgado has worked on the films Men in Black, Apollo 13, and The Incredibles.\n- The Incredibles is a 2004 American computer-animated superhero film.\n- Brad Bird wrote and directed The Incredibles.\n- Pixar Animation Studios produced The Incredibles, and Walt Disney Pictures released it.\n- Scary Stories for Sleep-overs is a series of scary children's books.\n- R.C. Welch, Q.L. Pearce, and various other authors wrote books in the Scary Stories for Sleep-overs series.\n- Ricardo Delgado, Bartt Warbuton, Dwight Been, and other illustrators contributed illustrations throughout the Scary Stories for Sleep-overs series.",
